  "details": "1. Open the Android app\n\n2. Go to the Search tab\n\n3. Search for a group\n\n4. Open the group\n\n5. Go to the Events tab\n\n6. Notice the week starts on a Sunday (Danish weeks start on a Monday)\n\n7. Notice that today (2027-02-11) is a Wednesday, but the app shows it as a Tuesday\n\nTony said they couldn't reproduce it. So it could be related to which day the week starts on. Which, here in Denmark is a Monday.\n\nversion 2026.1.1p1-1785-5dae3c02f0-Release",
